+/* Whether a click with this button and these modifiers is one that
+ * mouse-button-modifier takes over a window: its modifiers with the left,
+ * middle or right button, and with Shift too for the left one, a move that
+ * snaps. Caminito does the same over a window, and runs the shortcut only
